  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN274.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṉ ṟērppākaṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE said to [his] charioteer.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN274.1">
        <l>iruvicum patira muḻaṅki <supplied>vā</supplied>ṉaviṉ</l>
        <l>ṟikuppeya laḻituḷi <anchor n="1"/>talaii vāṉam</l>
        <l>paruvañ ceyta pāṉāṭ kaṅku</l>
        <l>lāṭutalait turuviṉ ṟōṭē mārppak</l>
        <l>kaṭaikōṟ ciṟu<supplied>tī</supplied> yaṭaiya māṭṭit</l>
        <l>tiṇkā luṟiyaṉ pāṉaiya ṉakala</l>
        <l><anchor n="2"/>nuṇpaḵ ṟuvalai yorutiṟa naṉaippat</l>
        <l>taṇṭukā lūṉṟiya taṉinilai yiṭaiyaṉ</l>
        <l>maṭiviṭu vīḷai kaṭituceṉ ṟicaippat</l>
        <l>teṟimaṟi pārkkuṅ kuṟunari verīi</l>
        <l>muḷḷuṭai kuṟuntū <anchor n="3"/>ṟiriyap pōkun</l>
        <l>taṇṇaṟum puṟavi ṉatuvē naṟumalar</l>
        <l>mullai cāṉṟa kaṟpiṉ</l>
        <l>melliyaṟ kuṟumaka ḷuṟaivi ṉūrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="12a-c">It [is] in the cool fragrant woodland,</l>
        <l corresp="3">where at night, midnight when the season makes</l>
        <l corresp="2">clouds, showering dwindling drops of breaking rain,</l>
        <l corresp="1">clouds uttering thunder so that the dark sky shakes,</l>
        <l corresp="8">the solitary shepherd, who leans on [his] staff,</l>
        <l corresp="7">	while the fine many drops wet [him] on one side,</l>
        <l corresp="6">	so that he departs, he with a pot, he with a net with firm threads,</l>
        <l corresp="5">	after having kindled to settle by a small fire from the end of the sticks,</l>
        <l corresp="4">	while the flock of sheep with moving heads bleat in confusion,</l>
        <l>goes, so that the short jackal, that is on the lookout for leaping lambs,</l>
        <l corresp="10f">	is frightened [and] retreats into the thorny small bushes,</l>
        <l corresp="9">	when a whistling sounds, moving quickly, emanating from the cloth,</l>
        <l corresp="14">– the village pleasing to stay of the little woman with soft nature,</l>
        <l corresp="12d-13">in [her] fidelity worthy of jasmine with fragrant blossoms.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

